<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-τάλαντος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[τᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worth many
				talents,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμος, μισθός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>, <i>Pro Merc.Cond.</i><i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; of a book, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγματεία π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.398e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>possessing many talents,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tox.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>weighing many talents,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα τὴν ὁλκήν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.5.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
